<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.4">
<l>māṉiṭa cātiyil tōṉṟiṟṟōr māṉiṭa cātiyai</l>
<l>māṉiṭa cātiyiṉ pēriṭṭāl maṟumaik killai</l>
<l>vāṉuṭai mātavā kōvintā veṉṟaḻait takkāl</l>
<l>nāṉuṭai nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>If one gives a human name to a human being</l>
<l rend="indent">born to the human species</l>
<l>there is no [going] to the next world.</l>
<l>If calling out “Govinda! Mādhava who possesses heaven!”,</l>
<l rend="indent">the mother of Nāraṇa, who rules me,</l>
<l>will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
